-Interactive shell
+Interactive %s
 
 multine
 single
@@ -81,7 +82,7 @@ quote
 --------------
 Snippet no. 3:
 --------------
-Interactive shell
+Interactive %s
 
 Here
 comes
@@ -92,7 +93,7 @@ doc
 --------------
 Snippet no. 4:
 --------------
-Interactive shell
+Interactive %s
 
 Done
 
@@ -100,7 +101,7 @@ Done
